{
  "type": "74hc161",
  "name": "74HC161 4-bit binary counter",
  "category": "Logic chips (DIP)",
  "prefix": "U",
  "description": "Synchronous 4-bit counter (DIP-16): counts at the rising edge of CP while CEP and CET are high, loads D0-D3 at the edge while PE is low, MR low clears it at once; TC is high at 15 while CET is high; runs as a digital chip: with a board or on its own, inputs from the rest of the circuit arrive up to 0.1 ms late (clocks up to a few kHz)",
